  "label": "Racist Stereotype: Indigenous people are primitive or irrational",
  "description": "This is a racist trope that portrays Indigenous peoples as primitive, irrational, or incapable of rational thought. It is used to justify colonialism, dispossession, and systemic oppression. In this meme, it is combined with misogyny to target Indigenous women specifically, reinforcing harmful racial and gender hierarchies.",
